# Snapshot exports — generated by scripts/pull-vercel-snapshots.mjs.
# All JSON files are gitignored, including listing-catalog.json and any
# listing-catalog-part-*.json chunks (Vercel 100MB multi-part split).
# Deploy them to Vercel by running the script locally and then `vercel deploy`
# (or via CI) so the built working tree is uploaded; they never need to live in git.
public/snapshots/latest/*.json

